10
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Every place has witnessed something.

11
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:50,000
RHYTHM Layer: When is this neighbourhood most alive?

12
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Any place on Earth. Search it. Feel it.

13
